1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,670
5 words to never say in productivity.

2
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:12,030
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say hustle, instead say system - because people hustle burns

3
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:15,210
out, systems compound.

4
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:20,910
Don't say work harder, instead say work smarter - effort isn't the edge.

5
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:27,810
Don't say more hours, instead say better blocks - hours don't scale, focus does.

6
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:33,990
Don't say multitask, instead say batch - batching actually finishes.

7
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:39,810
Don't say stay busy, instead say stay focused - busy is a trap.

8
00:00:39,990 --> 00:00:44,190
Your productivity does not have to sound like everyone else's.

9
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:48,110
Comment 'SYS' and I will send you the full list.

10
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:52,370
Make sure you follow - it only goes to followers.
